<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 11.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 11.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Monday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 11	Aug 08   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  290.780     292.550     247.020    17.72 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.910     307.830     306.830     0.35 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.415     156.530     158.970    -1.61 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.446	46.412	47.182    -1.56 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  463.100     458.460     419.180    10.48 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.850     138.925     141.685    -2.00 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.032	16.039	16.185    -0.95 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  250.810     248.250     212.430    18.07 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.855	 1.856	1.8880    -1.75 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.546	 1.549	1.5810    -2.21 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.115     191.245     183.135     4.36 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
